{"id":"c52212edb5f4e965","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Null Ideal","display":"df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal — ZFC Measure11 Null Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal — ZFC Measure11 Null Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal — ZFC Measure11 Null Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N},\\mu \\in V\">\\(\\mathcal{N},\\mu \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}null\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S(\\mathcal{N},\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal N=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land\\mu(B)=0)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}null\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S(\\mathcal{N},\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal N=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land\\mu(B)=0)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span> 包含所有可测零集的任意子集，因此即使原测度尚未完备，它仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 上的遗传零集理想。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{N},\\mu \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}null\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S(\\mathcal{N},\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\exists\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathcal N=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land\\mu(B)=0)\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":991,"backlinks":[{"id":"837919a2170e3c1d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11NullIdeal}_S$ (null-ideal predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2561","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-measure11-null-ideal]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}